- **{{ref:household}}:** {{ref:householdAdmin}}

**{{ref:description}}**

```text
Check a pending approval created by an earlier tool call, or list your own outstanding approvals. With approval_id: returns that approval's status (pending, approved, rejected, failed, expired, cancelled) and any stored execution result. Without approval_id: returns all of this access key's currently pending approvals (id, tool, created/expires), useful after a reconnect or to resume polling. Also returns agent_recovery records for this access key's interrupted Phoenix-owned provider turns. outcome_unknown blocks further writes until an administrator checks Home Assistant and reviews it in the Needs Attention window of the Phoenix MCP panel. dispatch_result is a receipt, not proof of physical completion. Never replay an uncertain action. Access keys only see their own records.
```

**{{ref:parameters}}**

```text
approval_id: string
  Omit to list all of this access key's pending approvals.
```

**{{ref:example}}**

```json
