blocks.set_dashboard_config:
- **{{ref:needs}}:** [{{label:caps.cap_lovelace_write.label}}](guide:window.capabilities#lovelace-write)
- **{{ref:hints}}:** {{ref:changes}} · {{ref:destructive}} · {{ref:idempotent}}
- **{{ref:onConfirm}}:** {{ref:confirmApproval}}

**{{ref:description}}**

```text
Replace a Lovelace dashboard's ENTIRE view and card layout. For adding, changing, or removing a single card, prefer add_dashboard_card / edit_dashboard_card / delete_dashboard_card, which do not resend the whole layout. Omit url_path for the default dashboard. Storage-mode dashboards only (YAML-mode is rejected). Adding or changing a template, a custom: card or an absolute URL always needs approval. Every layout write first takes a safety copy, so a layout that holds a credential or nests over 100 levels is refused, naming the location. A layout whose views, sections, badges or cards are not lists would not display, so it is refused. May require admin approval. Pass expected_hash (the content_hash from a prior get_dashboard_config) to make the write conditional: if the layout changed since you read it, the write is refused instead of overwriting the other change. A config containing the "<redacted>" placeholder from a lossy dashboard read is also refused; use patch_dashboard for one value or the individual card tools for a card change whose payload contains no placeholders, so untouched configuration is not resent.
```

**{{ref:parameters}}**

```text
url_path: string
  Dashboard url_path. Omit for the default dashboard.
config: object  (required)
  The full dashboard config (views and cards).
expected_hash: string
  Optional. The content_hash from a prior get_dashboard_config; the write is refused if the layout changed since then.
```

**{{ref:example}}**

```json
{
  "name": "set_dashboard_config",
  "arguments": {
    "url_path": "dashboard-energy",
    "config": {
      "views": [
        {
          "title": "Overview",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "energy-distribution"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "expected_hash": "0a1b2c3d4e5f6071"
  }
}
```

